```plaintext
0result.sql
```

Reason: 0result.sql multiplies projected 2021 local amounts by currency.to_us, which is the correct direction to convert local currency into U S D (to_us = “local‑to‑US” factor).  
1result.sql instead divides by the same rate, inverting the conversion and producing values in the wrong currency scale.  
Both scripts calculate the same growth factor, apply the same product/channel/promo filters, and average by month, but only 0result.sql performs the currency conversion correctly, so it is the right choice.